## Why This Is Asked
This probes practical E2E reasoning for multi-tenant isolation, real user journeys, and resilience under partial outages in a Stripe-like system.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-tenant data isolation (namespaces/tenants)
- Event-driven reconciliation and eventual consistency
- Idempotency and retry semantics across services
- Outage simulation and region-aware configuration
- Test data generation and privacy controls

