  // seed tenant, customers, invoices
  // navigate to checkout, complete purchase
  // assert invoice exists, ledger entries created
  // trigger event replay and verify read-model consistency
});
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you detect data leakage between tenants in this setup?
- How would you scale this to test hundreds of tenants in parallel without flakiness?

